No need of this.<br><br>Turn off the power switch,.<br>Pull the battery,.<br>Wait 2 secondes.<br>Reinsert the battery.<br>Press the key that boot into the bootloader.<br>Turn on the power switch. <br>Reflash the correct firmware this time.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Mon May 08, 2023 2:37 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
