		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2854&amp;p=23177#p23177"><![CDATA[
Any CPS version from 12th March onwards is OK<br><br>I just tested the GD-77, RD-5R and DM-1801 and when using older CPS, and there was no damage to the bootloader<br><br>When using the older CPS. The new firmware crashes, and the radio does not turn off.<br><br>So you must also remove and refit the battery.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Apr 29, 2023 10:09 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
